diada em Barcelinhos, com apoio do Munic\u00edpio de Barcelos.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde posso acompanhar as inscri\u00e7\u00f5es e o regulamento oficial?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A abertura de inscri\u00e7\u00f5es e os documentos regulamentares oficiais podem ser consultados diretamente no portal oficial dos Amigos da Montanha: https:\/\/www.amigosdamontanha.com\/trail-am-12.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":66312,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[22,672,497,498,499],"event_type_2":[52,726,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-48061","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-barcelos","event_type-trail","event_type-caminhada","event_type-trail-curto","event_type-trail-longo","event_type-trail-ultra","event_type_2-braga","event_type_2-porto-e-norte","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/trail-amigos-da-montanha-2026.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/48061","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=48061"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/48061\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":69243,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/48061\/revisions\/6924